{"day":"2026-10-04","items":[{"alias":"xhqcankao","day":"2026-10-04","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"全球\" data-ch=\"xhqcankao\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"xhqcankao\">风向旗参考快讯</span><span class=\"reach\">2 个频道</span><span class=\"cat\">全球</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-10-04T22:46:22+08:00\">10-04 22:46</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/32289\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">美国经销商要求购买英伟达 RTX 5090 整机的买家签署出口禁令承诺书</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">据外媒报道，一名美国消费者在加州Micro Center门店购买含英伟达RTX 5090显卡的整机时，被要求签署“购买者声明”，承诺不得将显卡带出美国境外。该声明要求填写身份信息、安装地点及用途，并严禁向计划转售至境外的人员出售。目前，Micro Center尚未对此回应，外界猜测此举或为遏制高端GPU转卖获利的威慑手段。\n\n—— IT之家</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/32289\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;887ce159501f23378b8356b8777a31b0254db9ca6cbdf7a71cee55e62f9a7548&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;美国经销商要求购买英伟达 RTX 5090 整机的买家签署出口禁令承诺书&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/xhqcankao/32289&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;风向旗参考快讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-10-04T22:46:22+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;据外媒报道，一名美国消费者在加州Micro Center门店购买含英伟达RTX 5090显卡的整机时，被要求签署“购买者声明”，承诺不得将显卡带出美国境外。该声明要求填写身份信息、安装地点及用途，并严禁向计划转售至境外的人员出售。目前，Micro Center尚未对此回应，外界猜测此举或为遏制高端GPU转卖获利的威慑手段。\\n\\n—— IT之家&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" vie