的相关工作。特朗普表示，该工作组将协调联邦政府与消费者、公共利益团体、宗教组织、关键基础设施提供商以及超级智能企业之间的沟通与合作。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/494839\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;be1512691ee2deeb0fe47af16044048d8d9e37fa12109698f67c20b39aacf797&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;特朗普宣布成立“超级智能特别工作组”&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/494839&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;华尔街见闻·财经时讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-10-04T21:05:08+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;当地时间10月4日，美国总统特朗普宣布成立“超级智能特别工作组”（Super Intelligence Force，SIF），负责协调美国联邦政府在超级智能领域的相关工作。特朗普表示，该工作组将协调联邦政府与消费者、公共利益团体、宗教组织、关键基础设施提供商以及超级智能企业之间的沟通与合作。&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-10-04T21:05:08+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-10-04T21:05:08+08:00","source":"FinanceNewsDaily","topic":"国际","uid":"be1512691ee2deeb0fe47af16044048d8d9e37fa12109698f67c20b39