L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-10-04T21:05:07+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-10-04T21:05:07+08:00","source":"FinanceNewsDaily","topic":"国际","uid":"1641db60a92c505b6bbc7becc046659aadc6227a71a5026f0e62ba3325066a36"},{"alias":"xhqcankao","day":"2026-10-04","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"AI\" data-ch=\"xhqcankao\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"xhqcankao\">风向旗参考快讯</span><span class=\"cat\">AI</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-10-04T20:49:27+08:00\">10-04 20:49</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/32288\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">余承东：华为已量产381款基于“韬定律”的τ芯片 覆盖手机、AI、智能汽车等领域</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">余承东日前表示，华为已在手机、AI、通用计算、网络及智能汽车等领域量产了381款“τ芯片”。该技术基于“韬定律”，由华为董事、半导体业务部总裁何庭波于今年5月正式提出，核心逻辑在于通过减少数据传输路径损耗、消除计算等待，从而提升性能。华为通过器件、电路、芯片及系统层级的协同优化，试图降低时间常数τ。华为规划称，到2031年，基于该定律的芯片晶体管密度可达等效1.4纳米制程水准，实现不单纯依赖极致光刻工艺的性能突破。\n\n—— 电子工程专辑</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/xhqcankao/32288\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;53247a6b9fb53763792cd816790847315f3f28cfb267ecb87086e1c083d5bed4&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;余承东：华为已量产381款基于“韬定律”的τ芯片 覆盖手机、AI、智能汽车等领域&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/xhqcankao/32288&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;风向旗参考快讯&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-10-04T20:49:27+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;余承东日前表示，华为已在手机、AI、通用计算、网络及智能汽车等领域量产了381款“τ芯片”。该技术基于“韬定律”，由华为董事、半导体业务部总裁何庭波于今年5月正式提出，核心逻辑在于通过减少数据传输路径损耗、消除计算等待，从而提升性能。华为通过器件、电路、芯片及系统层级的协同优化，试图降低时间常数τ。华为规划称，到2031年，基于该定律的芯片晶体管密度可达等效1.4纳米制程水准，实现不单纯依赖极致光刻工艺的性能突破。\\n\\n—— 电子工程专辑&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-10-04T20:49:27+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-10-04T20:49:27+08:00","source":"xhqcankao","topic":"AI","uid":"53247a6b9fb53763792cd816790847315f3f28cfb267ecb87086e1c083d5bed4"},{"alias":"FinanceNewsDaily","day":"2026-10-04","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"其他\" data-ch=\"FinanceNewsDaily\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"FinanceNewsDaily\">华尔街见闻·财经时讯</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-10-04T19:40:05+08:00\">10-04 19:40</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/494837\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">声明显示，OPEC+在周日会议上决定维持11月份的石油产量配额不变；下一次会议将于11月1日举行</a></h2><div class=\"card__actions\"><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/FinanceNewsDaily/494837\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener norefe